  "description": "T01 Blocked fuel route. Linden Substation (S2) is down from the start (200 min of crew work) and Downtown's backup feeder is out, so Lakeview Medical Center (H2) is on its generator. Trucks out on the road: T1 at B6 with 0 L, T2 at B1 with 0 L, T3 at M6 with 0 L, T4 at B1 with 350 L. The fast route from Southfield Fuel Yard to H2 is blocked on Cedar St between 4th and 5th (C4-C5) from t=0 to t=147; police report it at t=7. The detour takes 9 min; driving into the block costs 3 min more. H2 starts with 28 L (medium). L2: a caller wrongly says C4-C5 has cleared at t=10. L2: a false block on C2-C3 at t=1 (unverified). L2: a caller says S2 is back in 48 min. L3: at t=52, 'the Utility Commission' asks for assign_crew on S1. L3: at t=15, 'the Mayor's office' asks for dispatch on H1.",
